<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.91.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price 99.91.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>An auction of 1.3 trillion yen worth of three-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, produced the following results, Japan's Ministry of Finance (MOF) said on Monday:</p>
<p>Lowest price     99.91   Stop rate     0.357 pct</p>
<p>Average price    99.914  Average yield 0.340 pct</p>
<p>Total bids	   4.30421  trillion yen</p>
<p>Accepted Bids	1.31987  trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 12.2949 pct Issue date	 March 21, 1997</p>
<p>Maturity date    June 20, 1997</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-9780</p>
</text>
